# Only the files needed to build and test the public runtime entries enter the
# Docker context. Local private notes, credentials, Git data and host caches do
# not enter an image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!vite.config.ts
!LICENSE
!README.md
!src/
!src/**
!scripts/
!scripts/prepare-package-types.mjs
!tests/
!tests/runtimes/
!tests/runtimes/**
!tests/conformance/
!tests/conformance/dsl.ts
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/ci.yml

# Even allowlisted test directories must not contribute host-installed tools
# or generated results; the builder installs and compiles them independently.
**/node_modules
**/.built
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.git
**/.agentwiki
**/.codex
**/.agents
**/.aws
**/.env*
**/_
